<p>I had a similar idea for improving the image. I was going to suggest finding a cc or otherwise copyright free CAT scan or MRI coronal and/pr saggital images of the chest and abdomen. Erase the organs and put in some slices of arm bones. Because we will be looking at slices of the arm bones, it doesn't require much artistry. The long bones of the arm are not hard to imagine in section as they are pretty much just cylinders. It could even be coupled with a drawing like Rounzie's for clarity.</p>
